// Configuration for nf-test runs: the project's own, with notifications off.
//
// An nf-test run launches the real pipeline, and two of the Pipeline tests fail on
// purpose to check the stage guard, so a topic set in `.env` would push "run failed" to a
// channel other people are subscribed to every time anyone runs the suite. An empty topic
// is an explicit silence, which `ntfyTopic()` in workflows/modules/notify.nf tells apart
// from an unset one.
includeConfig '../nextflow.config'

params {
    ntfy_topic = ''
}
